"""Device icons (Material Design Icons, Apache-2.0): which icon a device gets and its SVG path.

Used by the dependency tree (server side) and handed to the graph (JavaScript), so both always agree.
The icon is chosen from the device role first, then from the device model, then from the device name;
the first rule that matches wins and no match means "no icon" (the pages then show a plain dot).
"""
